<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial average opened higher Thursday. The Nasdaq also rose.</p>
<p>Dow Industrials were up 14.02 at 7732.73. The 30-year long bond was up 4/32 at 6.68 percent yield.</p>
